WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:20.183
Bees flew all around the Throne Room.

2
00:00:20.183 --> 00:00:26.578
They landed on the queen's book.

3
00:00:26.578 --> 00:00:30.606
They tried to fly up the king's nose.

4
00:00:30.606 --> 00:00:33.163
Princess Mary looked scared.

5
00:00:33.163 --> 00:00:35.950
"Help!" she cried.

6
00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:38.428
"The bees will sting me!"

7
00:00:38.428 --> 00:00:41.567
The queen gasped.

8
00:00:41.567 --> 00:00:46.032
"A bee sting will kill Mary!" she said.

9
00:00:46.032 --> 00:00:48.648
"Shoo those bees away!"

10
00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:52.995
Everybody shooed bees away from the princess.

11
00:00:52.995 --> 00:01:00.755
"Bees don't like water," the prince said.

12
00:01:00.755 --> 00:01:04.879
He threw a bucket of water at the princess.

13
00:01:04.879 --> 00:01:07.915
The bees buzzed loudly.

14
00:01:07.915 --> 00:01:10.625
They flew around the princess.

15
00:01:10.625 --> 00:01:15.148
"Wizard! Make the bees flee!" the king cried.

16
00:01:15.148 --> 00:01:19.202
Tom lifted his wand.

17
00:01:19.202 --> 00:01:23.313
"Bees don't like to be inside," Cat whispered.

18
00:01:23.313 --> 00:01:26.897
"They like flowers."

19
00:01:26.897 --> 00:01:30.604
Cat opened a window.

20
00:01:30.604 --> 00:01:33.141
Tom waved his wand.

21
00:01:33.141 --> 00:01:42.650
"Bees, go where you please!" he cried.

22
00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:50.241
The bees flew out the window.

23
00:01:50.241 --> 00:01:52.983
The princess smiled at Tom.

24
00:01:52.984 --> 00:01:56.369
"You saved me!" she said.

25
00:01:56.369 --> 00:01:59.837
Tom turned red.

26
00:01:59.837 --> 00:02:05.640
Dirk came back to the Throne Room.

27
00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:09.419
Dirk was very dirty from cleaning the dungeon.

28
00:02:09.419 --> 00:02:13.874
"Er," Dirk mumbled. "That cat can stay.

29
00:02:13.874 --> 00:02:16.209
The rats brought the fleas.

30
00:02:16.209 --> 00:02:22.283
And Cat scared all the rats away."

31
00:02:22.284 --> 00:02:25.559
The queen took a deep sniff.

32
00:02:25.559 --> 00:02:28.346
She waved a hand in the air.

33
00:02:28.346 --> 00:02:31.727
"You stink, Dirk!" she said.

34
00:02:31.727 --> 00:02:48.458
"Go take another bath!"
